description:
Design a 4-to-2 priority encoder that outputs the binary position of the highest priority active input bit among four inputs. The output, `pos`, represents the index of the highest active input, with input position 3 having the highest priority and position 0 the lowest. If all inputs are inactive (0), the output will be 00, indicating no active input.
